#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:2
msgid "Mamba 简述：对RNN思想的回归"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`transformer` 告诉我们：Transformer 用 $O(n^2)$ 的代价换来了 $O(1)$ "
"的信息路径。这个权衡在大模型时代开始变得沉重——当序列长度达到百万级别（长视频、DNA序列、整本教科书），$n^2$ 的增长速度让 "
"Transformer 望而却步。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:6
msgid "**关键问题**：有没有办法在保持长程依赖能力的同时，把复杂度降回 $O(n)$？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Mamba {cite}`gu2023mamba` 给出的回答是：**有。而且答案就在 RNN 的 O(n) "
"骨架里——只是需要给它装上\"选择性\"。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:10
msgid "历史背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Transformer 的成功让注意力成为默认选择，但 O(n²) 的代价从未消失。研究者一直在寻找\"线性注意力\"——能够在 O(n) "
"时间内实现类似效果的技术。2020年代，Albert Gu 等人提出了一系列**结构化状态空间模型（S4）** "
"{cite}`gu2022efficiently`，展示了 SSM 在长序列建模上的潜力。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"2023年，Albert Gu 和 Tri Dao 提出了 **Mamba** "
"{cite}`gu2023mamba`，核心创新是**选择性机制**——让 SSM 的参数 $B_t, C_t, \\Delta_t$ "
"成为输入的函数。结合硬件感知的并行实现，Mamba 在保持 O(n) 效率的同时，首次在语言建模上达到了与 Transformer 相当的水平。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:17
msgid ""
"**历史意义**：Mamba 代表了序列建模的一个新方向——不是推翻 Transformer，而是在效率维度上超越它。它证明了 RNN "
"的骨架（O(n)、固定状态）只需\"选择性\"这剂药方，就能在现代硬件上重新焕发活力。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:20
msgid "思想回归：RNN骨架从未消失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:23
msgid "RNN的数学骨架"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid "回顾 {doc}`rnn-basics` 中的 RNN 公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t = \\tanh(\\mathbf{W}_h \\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{W}_x "
"\\mathbf{x}_t)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:31
msgid "这个公式有一个更一般的形式。考虑一个**连续的**微分方程——信号随时间平滑变化，而非一步步跳跃："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{h}'(t) = \\mathbf{A} \\mathbf{h}(t) + \\mathbf{B} "
"\\mathbf{x}(t), \\quad \\mathbf{y}(t) = \\mathbf{C} \\mathbf{h}(t)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:37
msgid "这就是 **状态空间模型（State Space Model, SSM）** 的连续形式。其中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf{h}(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^d$：时刻 $t$ 的隐状态（$d$ 是状态维度，类比 RNN 的 "
"`hidden_size`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{x}(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^m$：时刻 $t$ 的输入（$m$ 是输入维度）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{y}(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^k$：时刻 $t$ 的输出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{A} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times d}$：状态转移矩阵——控制\"旧记忆如何随时间衰减\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{B} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times m}$：输入投影矩阵——控制\"新信息如何进入记忆\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{C} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{k \\times d}$：输出投影矩阵——控制\"记忆如何转化为输出\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**和 RNN 的关系**：如果去掉 $\\tanh$，RNN 的 $\\mathbf{h}_t = \\mathbf{W}_h "
"\\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{W}_x \\mathbf{x}_t$ 就是 SSM 的离散版本——其中 "
"$\\mathbf{A} \\leftrightarrow \\mathbf{W}_h$，$\\mathbf{B} "
"\\leftrightarrow \\mathbf{W}_x$。RNN 多了一个 $\\tanh$ 来防止数值发散，而 SSM 用结构化的 "
"$\\mathbf{A}$ 矩阵来实现稳定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:49
msgid "**从连续到离散：离散化**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:51
msgid "连续形式的 SSM 不能直接用于深度学习（我们需要处理的是离散的词序列，而非连续信号）。需要将其**离散化**——把微分方程转换为递推公式。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:53
msgid "引入一个**步长 $\\Delta$（step size）**，表示连续时间中两次采样之间的间隔。离散化后："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:55
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{A}_d = e^{\\Delta \\mathbf{A}} \\approx \\mathbf{I} + \\Delta "
"\\mathbf{A}, \\quad \\mathbf{B}_d = (\\Delta \\mathbf{A})^{-1}(e^{\\Delta"
" \\mathbf{A}} - \\mathbf{I}) \\cdot \\Delta \\mathbf{B} \\approx \\Delta "
"\\mathbf{B}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:60
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**不需要记住这些矩阵指数！** 关键是理解离散化的直觉：步长 $\\Delta$ 越小，两次采样之间信号变化越小，$\\mathbf{A}_d "
"\\approx \\mathbf{I}$（几乎不衰减），$\\mathbf{B}_d \\approx \\Delta "
"\\mathbf{B}$（新信息按步长比例进入）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:63
msgid "用近似后的离散参数，SSM 的递推公式变为："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t = \\mathbf{A}_d \\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{B}_d "
"\\mathbf{x}_t, \\quad \\mathbf{y}_t = \\mathbf{C} \\mathbf{h}_t\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这就是 SSM 的**离散形式**——和 RNN 的骨架几乎一模一样，只是 $\\mathbf{A}_d, \\mathbf{B}_d$ 由 "
"$\\Delta$ 和连续参数 $\\mathbf{A}, \\mathbf{B}$ 计算而来。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:72
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**它和 RNN 有什么区别？** RNN 中 $\\mathbf{W}_h$ 是直接学习的任意矩阵，训练时可能不稳定。SSM 中的 "
"$\\mathbf{A}$ 被约束为特殊结构（如对角矩阵），且通过 $\\Delta$ "
"缩放后，数值上更可控——这为后面\"选择性让这一切按输入动态变化\"埋下了伏笔。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"过去十年，SSM 之所以没有取代 Transformer，是因为一个致命缺陷：**$\\mathbf{A}, \\mathbf{B}, "
"\\mathbf{C}, \\Delta$ "
"对所有输入都是一样的**——无论当前词是\"但是\"（暗示转折）还是\"的\"（结构助词），网络用同一套规则更新状态。这在需要**内容感知的推理"
"**（Content-Based Reasoning）时捉襟见肘。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:78
msgid "Mamba的洞察：让参数依赖输入"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Mamba 的核心创新是**选择性SSM（Selective SSM）**：让 $\\mathbf{B}$、$\\mathbf{C}$ 和步长 "
"$\\Delta$ 不再是固定的全局参数，而是**每个时间步根据当前输入 $\\mathbf{x}_t$ 动态计算**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{B}_t = \\text{Linear}_B(\\mathbf{x}_t), \\quad \\mathbf{C}_t = "
"\\text{Linear}_C(\\mathbf{x}_t), \\quad \\Delta_t = "
"\\text{softplus}(\\text{Linear}_\\Delta(\\mathbf{x}_t))\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:86
msgid "其中："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:87
msgid ""
"$\\text{Linear}_B, \\text{Linear}_C, \\text{Linear}_\\Delta$ "
"都是简单的**线性映射**——矩阵乘法加偏置（$Wx + b$），各有自己独立的可学习权重。$\\text{Linear}_B$ 和 "
"$\\text{Linear}_C$ 将 $d_{\\text{model}}$ 维输入投影到 $d_{\\text{state}}$ "
"维（$d_{\\text{state}}$ 是隐状态维度），$\\text{Linear}_\\Delta$ 投影为一个标量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:88
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\text{softplus}(z) = \\log(1 + e^z)$ 是一个平滑版的 ReLU（对照 {ref}`activation-"
"functions`）：当 $z$ 很大时接近 $z$，当 $z$ 很小时接近 0。用于确保步长 $\\Delta_t > "
"0$——状态更新不能\"倒退\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid "将这些输入依赖的参数代入 {ref}`state-space-model` 中的离散化递推，得到选择性的完整更新公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:92
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathbf{A}_{d,t} &= e^{\\Delta_t \\mathbf{A}} \\approx \\mathbf{I} + "
"\\Delta_t \\mathbf{A} \\\\[4pt]\n"
"\\mathbf{B}_{d,t} &\\approx \\Delta_t \\mathbf{B}_t \\\\[4pt]\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t &= \\mathbf{A}_{d,t} \\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\mathbf{B}_{d,t} "
"\\mathbf{x}_t \\\\[4pt]\n"
"\\mathbf{y}_t &= \\mathbf{C}_t \\mathbf{h}_t\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:102
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**和传统 SSM 的区别一目了然**：传统 SSM 中 $\\Delta, \\mathbf{B}, \\mathbf{C}$ "
"是固定的训练参数，对所有时间步都一样。选择性 SSM 中 $\\Delta_t, \\mathbf{B}_t, \\mathbf{C}_t$ "
"每一步都不同——由 $\\mathbf{x}_t$ 决定。**选择性 = 参数随时间步变化，变化规则由输入内容驱动。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:105
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在实际实现中（以及我们的代码中），做进一步的简化：假设 $\\mathbf{A}$ "
"是对角矩阵（每个状态维度独立衰减），略去矩阵指数，直接用标量形式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:107
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t = \\mathbf{A} \\odot \\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\Delta_t \\cdot "
"(\\mathbf{B}_t \\odot \\mathbf{x}_t), \\quad \\mathbf{y}_t = "
"\\mathbf{C}_t^\\top \\mathbf{h}_t\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:111
msgid ""
"其中 $\\odot$ 是逐元素乘法（{ref}`lstm-forget-gate` 中 $\\mathbf{f}_t \\odot "
"\\mathbf{c}_{t-1}$ 的同款操作）。$\\mathbf{A} \\in "
"\\mathbb{R}^{d_{\\text{state}}}$ 是衰减率向量（每个维度独立衰减），$\\mathbf{B}_t, "
"\\mathbf{C}_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_{\\text{state}}}$ 是选择性输入/输出门。注意这里 "
"$\\mathbf{B}_t, \\mathbf{C}_t$ 是向量（而非矩阵）——这是对角 SSM 的简化，在教学中足够传达核心思想。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:113
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这个简化版本把公式变得极其清晰：**状态更新就是衰减率 $\\mathbf{A}$ × 旧记忆 + 步长 $\\Delta_t$ × 选择性写入的"
" $\\mathbf{B}_t \\odot \\mathbf{x}_t$**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:115
msgid "为什么\"选择性\"是关键？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:117
msgid "传统 SSM 失败的原因可以用一个例子说明。考虑处理这句话："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:119
msgid "\"今天天气很好，**所以**我决定去公园散步。\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:121
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"当网络读到\"所以\"时，它需要知道\"所以\"是一个因果连接词，暗示前面的\"天气很好\"是后面\"散步\"的原因。但传统 SSM "
"对所有词都使用**同一套** $\\mathbf{A}, \\mathbf{B}, "
"\\mathbf{C}$——它无法区分\"所以\"（需要触发因果推理）和\"的\"（结构助词，可以忽略）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:123
msgid "选择性机制让网络能够**根据当前输入的内容，动态调整状态更新的策略**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:125
msgid "逐步拆解三个选择性参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:127
msgid "**参数一：$\\Delta_t$（步长）——\"当前输入有多重要？\"**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "符号"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "含义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "维度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "直觉理解"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\text{Linear}_\\Delta$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "一个可学习的线性映射"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbb{R}^{d} \\to \\mathbb{R}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
msgid "学到\"什么样的输入是重要的、需要大步伐更新\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\text{softplus}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
msgid "$\\log(1 + e^x)$，输出始终为正"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
msgid "标量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:101
msgid "确保步长为正，且平滑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:134
msgid "$\\Delta_t$ 控制的是**状态更新的\"步幅\"**。回顾状态更新公式："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:136
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{h}_t = \\mathbf{A} \\mathbf{h}_{t-1} + \\Delta_t \\cdot "
"(\\mathbf{B}_t \\mathbf{x}_t)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:140
msgid "$\\Delta_t$ 大 → 网络认为当前输入很重要，大步更新状态（类似于 LSTM 中输入门大开）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:141
msgid "$\\Delta_t$ 小 → 网络认为当前输入不重要，几乎不更新状态（类似于 LSTM 中输入门紧闭，遗忘门全开）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:144
msgid ""
"**直觉**：读\"的\"时，$\\Delta_t$ 可能很小——\"保持当前状态，这个字不重要\"。读\"所以\"时，$\\Delta_t$ "
"可能很大——\"注意！这里有关键转折，需要更新理解\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:146
msgid "这种机制让 Mamba 自动学会了**对关键信息\"聚焦\"、对冗余信息\"忽略\"**，而无需显式设计门控逻辑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:149
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**参数二：$\\mathbf{B}_t$（输入投影）——\"新信息的哪些维度值得记？\"**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\text{Linear}_B$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "$\\mathbb{R}^{d} \\to \\mathbb{R}^{d_{\\text{state}}}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "学到\"如何从当前输入中提取值得记录的信息\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{B}_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "输入依赖的投影向量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "$\\mathbb{R}^{d_{\\text{state}}}$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "决定输入 $\\mathbf{x}_t$ 的哪些方向应该进入隐状态"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:156
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在传统 SSM 中，$\\mathbf{B}$ 是一个固定矩阵——所有输入用同一种方式投影。选择性 SSM 中，$\\mathbf{B}_t$ "
"随输入变化——\"所以\"和\"的\"产生不同的 "
"$\\mathbf{B}_t$，\"所以\"的投影可能强调\"转折/因果\"相关维度，而\"的\"的投影可能接近零向量（\"没什么值得记录的\"）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:158
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**参数三：$\\mathbf{C}_t$（输出投影）——\"记忆中的哪些部分现在该说出来？\"**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\text{Linear}_C$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "学到\"基于当前输入，哪些记忆应该被输出\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{C}_t$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
msgid "输入依赖的输出投影"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/sequence-modeling/mamba-intro.md:143
#, python-brace-format
